    "_comment": [
      "Inference backend. The shim does NOT link libonnxruntime.so: src/ort_runtime.cpp dlopen()s",
      "it and resolves the ABI-stable C API through OrtGetApiBase() (see src/ort_runtime.h). That is",
      "why the shim keeps loading - and Engine::Init keeps returning false - when the runtime is",
      "absent, exactly like the Paddle-Lite artifact.",
      "Android: a single multi-ABI AAR from Maven Central; the per-ABI libonnxruntime.so bytes",
      "inside it are what gets published and are pinned separately below.",
      "The Android runtime links only libc/libdl/liblog/libandroid/libm (libc++ is statically",
      "linked), so it adds NO libc++_shared.so dependency of its own; the NDK libc++_shared.so is",
      "needed only by our own shim (and by opencv-mobile's OpenMP use of libomp.so)."
    ],
