    "_comment": [
      "Official PaddlePaddle PP-OCRv6 small ONNX exports. v6 small is the smallest v6 tier whose",
      "recogniser still covers Japanese kana (86 hiragana + 94 katakana); v6 tiny has none and must",
      "not be used. The ONNX graphs are architecture-independent, so one model set runs on every ABI.",
      "`revision` is the HuggingFace commit the bytes were fetched from."
    ],
